{"id":"n3-057","title":"～というの～ (〜to iu no〜)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Explain or emphasize the reason for a situation or action.","longExplanation":"The ～というの〜 grammar point is used to provide an explanation or emphasize the reason for a certain situation or action. It can be translated as 'the reason is that...', or 'it's because...'.","formation":"Verb-casual + というの, い-Adjective + というの, な-Adjective + だというの, Noun + だというの","examples":[{"jp":"遅刻したのは、電車が遅れたというのだ。","romaji":"Chikoku shita no wa, densha ga okureta to iu no da.","en":"The reason I was late is because the train was delayed.","words":[{"surface":"遅刻","vocabId":"1422050","reading":"ちこく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電車","vocabId":"1443530","reading":"でんしゃ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れ","vocabId":"1422020","reading":"おくれ","baseForm":"遅れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[10,11]},{"jp":"この部屋が汚いのは、掃除をしなかったというのだ。","romaji":"Kono heya ga kitanai no wa, souji o shinakatta to iu no da.","en":"The reason this room is dirty is because I didn't clean it.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"汚い","vocabId":"1178940","reading":"きたない"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"掃除","vocabId":"1399790","reading":"そうじ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[12,13]},{"jp":"彼女が怒っているのは、彼が約束を破ったというのだ。","romaji":"Kanojo ga okotte iru no wa, kare ga yakusoku o yabutta to iu no da.","en":"The reason she is angry is that he broke his promise.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"怒っ","vocabId":"1445690","reading":"おこる","baseForm":"怒る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"約束","vocabId":"1538130","reading":"やくそく"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"破っ","vocabId":"1471200","reading":"やぶる","baseForm":"破る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[14,15]},{"jp":"彼が成功したのは、努力して勉強したというのだ。","romaji":"Kare ga seikou shita no wa, doryoku shite benkyou shita to iu no da.","en":"The reason he succeeded is because he studied hard.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"